{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "305e25ed71e1cb9976b4137adbd55f5604acc4bd3e8300b7ba586149d5143d55", "ja": "（千早は『Melty Fantasia』の外伝に出演中。\n人類を管理するAIシステムに抗う役を務める……）", "zh": "（千早正在出演《Melty Fantasia》的外传。她饰演的是反抗管理人类的AI系统的角色……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "00a68d5fe6af3d499ad4c587bdbd088b1d73334400f1483556d120e4b56404fa", "ja": "自分たちに逆らう者は、不穏分子として世界から\n抹消する……。これが絶対の公平？　大いなる意思？", "zh": "把反抗自己的人作为不安定分子从世界上抹去……这就是绝对的公平？伟大的意志？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "73c42c37ed4882498dad40edc595d8d1e507b3b5d875194dcc70b6f212886abb", "ja": "マザーの言うことを信じないで、セリカ！\n自由を奪われては、誰も幸せになんてなれないわ……！", "zh": "不要相信“母亲”说的话，星梨花！一旦失去了自由，谁都不可能获得幸福……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "f267b700c9cf3d517a7b84cbd617b40dd032662a2c2f3f45e8d9580cc1bd3bc7", "ja": "……ふぅ。彼女の抱える感情は、\nまだまだこんなものじゃないはず……。", "zh": "……呼。她心中的情感，\n应该还远远不止这种程度才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8b585da174aac8faafc611465b0ba734bcc93e66cd786e100787e1842b78468f", "ja": "お疲れ様、千早。\n休憩の間だけでも、頭を休めたらどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，千早。\n哪怕只在休息期间，也让脑袋歇一歇吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "623e13146b2a6afe2c0804a7ea276ad9783e7d0525107319c3c4e68e9b750aa6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。\nすみません、ご心配をおかけして。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……\n抱歉，让您担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "ea0ffe77b838a580ee5b7d136c15bfabd27f85085fa7b86fb2b3669c0a333aec", "ja": "でも今は、一分一秒を大事に……少しでも、\nチハヤの気持ちを理解する時間に充てたくて。", "zh": "不过现在，我想珍惜每一分每一秒……哪怕只有一点时间，也想用来理解千早的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1007_p", "source_sha256": "47e1fdcd679e17e9b16a258f5244ab892402c8c6ec7de9fadb09dabc96939427", "ja": "そうか……。さっきのシーンも、\nあまり納得いってない様子だったもんな。", "zh": "这样啊……刚才那一幕，你看起来也不是很满意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "e5528dc7d2317683002469cf3b535e3e8baa6c05e1b38a528d05f7af9d87932e", "ja": "……。仲間や子ども達を大切にしている彼女が、\n世界に抗うため、銃を手に取る。", "zh": "……珍视同伴与孩子们的她，\n为了反抗世界，拿起了枪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "892719e3387d39c7a1ab25554061f51694b3e076fdc204f8151798f763d84ff6", "ja": "その覚悟は、並大抵のものではないはずです。\nそこにはきっと、絶望や悲しみ、怒りがあって……。", "zh": "那份觉悟，绝非寻常。\n其中一定饱含着绝望、悲伤与愤怒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "4c325a6c6c22bc119250f0ee0f32f6418593e97bba046f3414e142efd53472a0", "ja": "チハヤという人間を演じるからには、彼女のすべてを\n表現すること。それが、私の役目だと思うんです。", "zh": "既然要饰演名为千早的人，就要表现出她的一切。我认为，这就是我的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7dfc36c1e24757e2124d70f79aa1b1d1b907611381c0819178dc03520c1e6038", "ja": "確かに。チハヤは、将来リーダーになる人物だ。\n演じる側にも、相応の覚悟がないと難しいってことか。", "zh": "确实。千早是将来会成为领袖的人物。\n扮演她的人，如果没有相应的觉悟，确实很难胜任啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "9d0689e9a37889d1518c5e7cd9e8161feca2f6cc17620c77912b55f97c10590a", "ja": "はい。演じていくうちに、台本だけでは気づけ\nなかった、彼女の気持ちがわかってきて……。", "zh": "是的。随着演绎下去，我逐渐明白了她的心情……这些都是光看剧本时无法察觉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "b751affd1fe24aeb1ff86ae626a13534a66004d6df56c4184cc684cf5f85626f", "ja": "彼女に寄り添えた今だからこそ、\nこの大切なシーンは妥協したくないんです。", "zh": "正因为如今已经能贴近她的内心，\n所以在这场重要的戏里，我才不想妥协。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d8d317677ae1ded44942e6ee50a71acaf3a5fff85483aaa22c77123894ac8c34", "ja": "千早……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5138204e00853948c1c223befedfbfd9b0c52f7a0c769c20bf9d19b8c47cdddc", "ja": "よし、わかった！\n昼休憩を返上する勢いで、しっかり役を詰めていこう！", "zh": "好，明白了！\n那就拿出连午休都顾不上的劲头，把角色好好琢磨透吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "114bedef91244d0a389042404524b3e17604b45df9a3571c5d643c92ffde16f0", "ja": "えっ……いいんですか？\nてっきり、止められるものとばかり……。", "zh": "咦……这样真的可以吗？\n我还以为你肯定会阻止我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e9d894744e3cff32e4e61af01ae5cf1b0180e1388e90d244b622e5f0d0f21da7", "ja": "そのつもりだったけど、千早の覚悟を聞いたら、な。", "zh": "本来是打算阻止你的，不过听到千早的决心后，就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2a70f204400791c14e5cef6d0056ee49c92d3be7b9aa5430313203bc2978638e", "ja": "ただし、俺も付き合うよ。無茶を止める人がいないと、\nこのあとの撮影にも響くしな。", "zh": "不过，我也陪你一起。要是没人阻止你乱来，也会影响接下来的拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "5e17b972975ef96ddc69b756a51888bced3c255fb6a1731f5af3947a1477e712", "ja": "{$P$}……すみません。\nあ、こういう時は、ありがとうございます、ですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}……对不起。\n啊，这种时候应该说“谢谢您”，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "acf33a29464383e114a39c9ae7b84afe1a71120e60e978012297fcc8d7a5722f", "ja": "その代わり約束します。彼女の……チハヤのすべてを\n届けると。必ず素晴らしい作品にしてみせます……！", "zh": "作为交换，我保证。我会将她……千早的一切都呈现出来。一定会把它拍成出色的作品……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0534_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a0e28270ba9ceb1acf98097ef5637452c91a57b00acc32f870d4a632fdbe4986", "ja": "（休憩返上の甲斐もあってか、その後の撮影は\n素晴らしい出来になった。さて、遅い休憩にしようか）", "zh": "（也许是因为连休息时间都投入了，之后的拍摄效果非常出色。那么，接下来就去休息吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
